### Signature line (locked — Chat #78)
Every draft ends with deterministic rotating closing + brand signature:

```javascript
const closings = ['Warm regards', 'Warmly', 'Cheers!', 'Have the best day!'];
const closingIndex = sessionIndex % closings.length;
const closing = closings[closingIndex];
const signature = closing + ',\n' + brand_name + ' – ' + brand_location;
```

### Tier detection
Demo has no HSI agent. Tier is determined by a **lightweight classification Code Node** before Claude calls:

```
Review contains: discrimination / harassment / humiliation language → T3
Review contains: negative language + frustration / complaint → T2
Review is positive or mixed → T1
```

### Claude model
`claude-sonnet-4-6` — same as production RDA.

### Credentials
`Subtext-CX-Anthropic` — existing credential in n8n. No new credential needed.

