**Call 3 — SEO + Governance:**
Same 3-task structure (SEO integration + governance check + guest name check).
SEO keywords = brand_name + brand_location (derived from form, not Client Config).

**Call 4 — Internal Brief:**
**SKIPPED in demo.** Demo returns public draft only. Saves ~2-3 seconds latency.

**Call 5 — Audit:**
Same 11-item checklist as production. Fallback to pre-audit draft if parse fails.

**Total calls: 4 (not 5). Estimated latency: 8-12 seconds.**

