## 9. N8N ARCHITECTURE CONSTRAINTS (PERMANENT — all chats)

- n8n version: 2.4.6 — DO NOT UPGRADE
- No spread operators — key-by-key construction only
- IF node fires both branches simultaneously — gate FALSE with `return []`
- `console.warn` and unused variable declarations blocked
- PATCH = JSON body mode (not RAW)
- `for...of` loops cause red highlight — use index-based `for` loops
- NocoDB URL inside n8n = `http://nocodb:8080` (never localhost)
- NocoDB defaults to 25 records — always set explicit `limit=1000` in GET URLs
- Webhook payload extraction: `$input.first().json.body`
- Boolean IF — use Code Node
- Payload parse: `typeof body==='string'?JSON.parse(body):body`
- Claude output: strip ```json fences before JSON.parse
- No template literals with curly braces in Code Nodes — use string concatenation

